	(text "J1 pin number = box-header pin = ribbon conductor.\nJ1 pin NAME (DIPn) = DIP-16 plug pin = DX U701 socket pin.\nIDC mapping (header->DIP): 1->1 2->16 3->2 4->15 5->3 6->14\n7->4 8->13 9->5 10->12 11->6 12->11 13->7 14->10 15->8 16->9.\nTO BE CONFIRMED with a continuity meter before first power-up.\nDIP 10/12/15 (snare) come from the mux U3, never from U1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b27fee33-33be-5e94-b7d1-57b9a0342dff"))
